        <calculation class='tableau' formula='MAX(IF DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;, [date]) = DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;, DATEADD(&apos;month&apos;, -12, TODAY())) &#10;AND DAY([date]) &lt;= DAY(TODAY()-1)&#10;THEN [eu_yoy_month_cumulative_cum_distinct_cnt] END)&#10;/*&#10;MAX(IF DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;, [Date]) = DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;, DATEADD(&apos;month&apos;, -12, TODAY())) &#10;AND DAY([Date]) &lt;= DAY(TODAY()-2)&#10;THEN [Eu Yoy Month Cumulative Cum Distinct Cnt] END)*/' />
      </column>
      <column caption='CVR LW Growth' datatype='string' name='[Incentivised Order LW Growth (copy)_582371763027628032]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF &#10;((SUM(IF [is_yesterday (copy)_3533636887883218944] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_yesterday (copy)_3533636887883218944] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END))&#10;- (SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END)))&#10;/ (SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END)) &gt;= 0&#10;THEN &apos;▲&apos; ELSE &apos;▼&apos; END&#10;&#10;+ &apos; &apos;&#10;&#10;+ &#10;STR(&#10;ROUND( &#10;((SUM(IF [is_yesterday (copy)_3533636887883218944] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_yesterday (copy)_3533636887883218944] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END))&#10;- (SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END)))&#10;/ (SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END))&#10;&#10;* 100&#10;, 1)&#10;)' />
      </column>
      <column caption='CVR LW Growth Ranking' datatype='real' name='[Incentivised Order LW Growth Ranking (copy)_582371763027939329]' role='measure' type='ordinal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='((SUM(IF [is_yesterday (copy)_3533636887883218944] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_yesterday (copy)_3533636887883218944] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END))&#10;- (SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END)))&#10;/ (SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [transaction] ELSE 0 END) / SUM(IF [is_same_day_last_week (copy)_3533636887903768587] THEN [sessions] ELSE 0 END))' />
